{"seq":12,"slug":"digital-anthropology","title":"数字人类学","stage":"DONE","category":"anthropology","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/digital-anthropology","rating":{"composite":3.51,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 数字人类学\n\n当 2026 年 4 月全球互联网用户突破 61.2 亿、社交媒体用户达到 57.9 亿（约占世界人口的 69.9%，据 [DataReportal Digital 2026](https://datareportal.com/reports/digital-2026-mid-year-global-update-report)），人类生活已经被屏幕、信号与算法深深地编织进来。数字人类学正是研究这种被数字技术中介的社会生活的学科。它不把「网络」当成一块与现实割裂的飞地，而是追问：当亲属、礼物、仪式、劳动、权力这些古老的人类学母题搬到 WhatsApp 群、抖音直播间与加密钱包里，它们如何延续，又如何被重塑。\n\n这个 hub 沿四条主线递进，从方法到议题层层展开。\n\n第一条主线是「基础与方法」。它先交代数字人类学如何从二十世纪末的赛博文化研究中长出来，又如何在 Daniel Miller、Tom Boellstorff 等人手里转向「数字日常」的细致民族志；随后讲清在线田野怎么做——参与式观察如何延伸到聊天记录与算法推荐流，以及抓取数据时绕不开的伦理与知情同意；最后处理虚拟社群与数字社会性，拆穿「线上 vs 线下」这个早已失效的二分。\n\n第二条主线是「身份与日常」。人在不同平台上如何呈现自我，这是数字时代的戈夫曼问题；社交媒体如何渗进吃饭、哀悼、谈恋爱这些最普通的日常实践；而支撑这一切的，是海底光缆、数据中心与手机这些常被忽视的物质基础设施——数字从来不是非物质的。\n\n第三条主线是「经济与权力」。平台经济重组了劳动，全球约 4.35 亿零工劳动者（据世界银行）被算法调度，而 2026 年 6 月国际劳工组织刚通过史上第一部平台劳动公约；算法、数据与监控构成新的权力形态；数字鸿沟则提醒我们，仍有约 22 亿人不在网中，技术红利的分配从来不平等。\n\n第四条主线是「前沿议题」。生成式 AI 让人与机器的关系成为新的人类学田野，数百万人已经把聊天机器人当作朋友甚至伴侣；加密货币、元宇宙与数字货币重新定义了价值与所有权；而宗教与死亡——人类最古老的两件事——也在以数字形式被重新实践。\n\n四条主线并非彼此孤立：方法支撑议题，身份嵌入经济，经济决定鸿沟，前沿回头质疑基础。读完整个 hub，你会得到一副用人类学透镜观察数字世界的眼镜——既不技术乐观，也不末日悲观，而是贴着真实的人去看他们如何在比特与信号中过日子。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations-methods","title":"基础与方法","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/digital-anthropology/foundations-methods","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"intro-to-digital-anthropology","title":"数字人类学导论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/digital-anthropology/foundations-methods/intro-to-digital-anthropology"},{"seq":2,"slug":"digital-ethnography-methods","title":"数字民族志与在线田野方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/digital-anthropology/foundations-methods/digital-ethnography-methods"},{"seq":3,"slug":"virtual-communities-sociality","title":"虚拟社群与数字社会性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/digital-anthropology/foundations-methods/virtual-communities-sociality"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"identity-everyday","title":"身份与日常","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/digital-anthropology/identity-everyday","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"online-identity-self-presentation","title":"在线身份与自我呈现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/digital-anthropology/identity-everyday/online-identity-self-presentation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"social-media-everyday-life","title":"社交媒体与日常生活","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/digital-anthropology/identity-everyday/social-media-everyday-life"},{"seq":3,"slug":"digital-materiality-infrastructure","title":"数字物质性与基础设施","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/digital-anthropology/identity-everyday/digital-materiality-infrastructure"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"economy-power","title":"经济与权力","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/digital-anthropology/economy-power","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"platform-economy-digital-labor","title":"平台经济与数字劳动","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/digital-anthropology/economy-power/platform-economy-digital-labor"},{"seq":2,"slug":"algorithms-data-surveillance","title":"算法、数据与监控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/digital-anthropology/economy-power/algorithms-data-surveillance"},{"seq":3,"slug":"digital-divide-global-south","title":"数字鸿沟与全球南方","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/digital-anthropology/economy-power/digital-divide-global-south"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"frontiers","title":"前沿议题","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/digital-anthropology/frontiers","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"anthropology-of-ai-human-machine","title":"人工智能与人机关系的人类学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/digital-anthropology/frontiers/anthropology-of-ai-human-machine"},{"seq":2,"slug":"crypto-metaverse-digital-money","title":"加密、元宇宙与数字货币","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/digital-anthropology/frontiers/crypto-metaverse-digital-money"},{"seq":3,"slug":"digital-religion-death","title":"数字宗教与数字死亡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/anthropology/digital-anthropology/frontiers/digital-religion-death"}]}]}